error: invalid storage class in nested function definition: `inner`
 --> sema-nested-function-storage.c:2:5
  |
2 |     static int inner(void) { return 0; }
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^ storage class is not allowed on a nested definition
  |
  = note: C99 §6.7.1p5: a function declared in a block has no explicit storage class other than extern; GCC also rejects extern on a nested definition, which has no linkage

